{
  "episode_id": "2026-07-27",
  "chunks": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "听众朋友大家好，欢迎收听AI 每日先锋， 今天是2026年7月27日。我是苏晴。",
      "start": 1.0,
      "duration": 7.75,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_001_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_001_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "大家好，我是周航。",
      "start": 9.199,
      "duration": 1.611,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_002_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_002_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "周航，你知道我最近看到一个特别有意思的说法，说AI行业的下一个关键词，已经从\"模型\"变成\"Agent\"了。",
      "start": 11.307,
      "duration": 12.408,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_003_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_003_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "嗯，这个说法我前段时间在推特上也看到过。 你注意啊，这话如果放在一年前说，大家可能还会半信半疑，但现在你再看，不管是开源社区还是那些闭源大厂，几乎全都在押注Agent这个方向。",
      "start": 24.168,
      "duration": 17.565,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_004_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_004_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "对，而且今天我们节目里要聊的几条新闻其实都跟这个趋势有关系。一个是吴恩达亲自下场做了个开源桌面Agent，另一个是Opus 5模型直接打榜，把竞争对手按在地上摩擦。",
      "start": 42.138,
      "duration": 19.742,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_005_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_005_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "说白了，就是两拨人用不同的方式在抢同一个未来。 开源派想的是让每个人都能自己跑Agent，闭源派想的是把Agent能力卷到极致然后卖给你。",
      "start": 62.313,
      "duration": 13.932,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_006_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_006_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "那咱们先说吴恩达这个。 这个名字在AI圈那可是祖师爷级别的人物，他亲自下场做的项目，你想想含金量。",
      "start": 76.71,
      "duration": 10.449,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_007_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_007_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "对，你注意啊，吴恩达在AI教育圈的地位不用多说，他这次推出的这个桌面Agent最大的特点就是三个： 100%开源、隐私优先、模型无关。",
      "start": 87.621,
      "duration": 14.541,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_008_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_008_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "模型无关是什么意思哈？ 我想给听众朋友解释一下。",
      "start": 102.613,
      "duration": 6.618,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_009_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_009_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "简单说，就是这个Agent不绑定任何特定的AI模型。 你可以用OpenAI的，可以用Anthropic的，也可以用开源的Llama本地跑都行。 这就意味着开发者不会被任何一家厂商绑架。",
      "start": 109.731,
      "duration": 13.864,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_010_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_010_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "哦这就懂了， 就相当于一个万能遥控器，你想接什么电视就接什么电视。",
      "start": 124.033,
      "duration": 5.66,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_011_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_011_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你这个类比还挺准的。而且重点是\"桌面\"这两个字， 过去这类Agent大多是在云端跑，数据得上传到服务器，那对于处理敏感信息的人来说就很头疼。",
      "start": 130.154,
      "duration": 11.818,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_012_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_012_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "对啊， 比如律师、医生，还有一些搞商业机密的人，他们肯定不放心把数据传到别人服务器上。",
      "start": 142.417,
      "duration": 11.45,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_013_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_013_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "所以吴恩达这个项目的意义不只是又多了个工具，而是它把Agent的能力真正交到了每一个开发者手里。 你想想，当一个门槛被彻底砸穿之后，本地化、个性化的Agent生态会爆发出什么样的能量。",
      "start": 154.341,
      "duration": 16.085,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_014_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_014_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "我跟你说，这个事情的影响可能比我们想的还要大。 以前我们说个人AI助理，那是OpenAI、Anthropic这些公司垄断的玩法，现在开源了，相当于把\"造个人助理\"这件事变成了一个全民运动。",
      "start": 170.853,
      "duration": 15.998,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_015_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_015_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "没错，而且吴恩达自己也有足够的行业号召力，他这个项目出来之后，估计很快就会有一批基于它的二次开发。咱们可能会看到各种各样针对特定场景的桌面Agent冒出来。",
      "start": 187.315,
      "duration": 13.758,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_016_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_016_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这也太有看头了，AI的\"安卓时刻\"是不是要来了？",
      "start": 201.49,
      "duration": 6.095,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_017_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_017_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "这个比喻很有野心，但也不是不可能。 Android当年就是把塞班和iOS之外的市场全部吃了下来，现在桌面Agent这个赛道，其实也在经历类似的过程。",
      "start": 208.021,
      "duration": 13.951,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_018_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_018_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "好的说完开源咱们再说闭源。Opus 5这个模型你看了没？",
      "start": 222.389,
      "duration": 5.399,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_019_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_019_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "看了，我看完只有一句话想说，这就是那个熟悉的\"AI圈卷王\"又回来了。",
      "start": 228.284,
      "duration": 6.748,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_020_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_020_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "哈哈哈\"卷王\"这个词用得太准了。它这次具体表现怎么样？",
      "start": 235.444,
      "duration": 6.618,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_021_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_021_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你注意啊，它最让人意外的地方是用一半的价格，跑出了超过Fable 5的实测表现。注意我这个用词，是\"超过\"，不是\"接近\"。",
