        "lively": "chunk_030_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "对，而且价格还便宜了一半。这对中小公司和独立开发者来说简直是福音呀，以前觉得用不起顶级模型，现在直接\"旧时王谢堂前燕，飞入寻常百姓家\"了。",
      "start": 343.639,
      "duration": 17.371,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_031_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_031_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你这句诗用得挺应景的哈哈。说白了，AI行业现在的竞争已经不是单纯的\"谁更聪明\"，而是\"谁更聪明还更便宜\"。",
      "start": 361.497,
      "duration": 11.581,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_032_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_032_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "说到这件事，我突然想起来，谷歌最近动静也挺大的，咱们花点时间聊聊。",
      "start": 373.52,
      "duration": 5.224,
      "audios": {
